<title>IRAQ: Iraq and Turkey sign deal to build gas pipeline.</title>
<headline>Iraq and Turkey sign deal to build gas pipeline.</headline>
<dateline>BAGHDAD 1997-05-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iraq and Turkey on Saturday signed an agreement to build a gas pipeline to export Iraqi gas to the world.</p>
<p>&quot;We have signed an agreement between us under which gas would be transferred from Iraq to world markets,&quot; said Turkish Energy Minister Recai Kutan after signing the deal with Iraq's Oil Minister Amir Muhammad Rasheed.</p>
</text>
